          "query": "family hiking mountains",
          "dia_id": "D18:15",
          "re-download": true,
          "text": "Yeah for sure. Having my fam around helps a lot. It makes hard times easier."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Caroline",
          "dia_id": "D18:16",
          "text": "Wow, great pic! Is that recent? Looks like you all had fun!"
